@base = http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/v1

### Database readiness
GET {{base}}/health/ready

### Menus and recipes (use IDs returned here)
GET {{base}}/menus

### Ingredient quantities use each ingredient's stored unit
GET {{base}}/inventory

### Replace recipe per portion; IDs below refer to fresh demo seed only
PUT {{base}}/menus/1/recipe
Content-Type: application/json

{"lines":[{"ingredientId":1,"quantity":0.15},{"ingredientId":2,"quantity":0.1}]}

### Stock receipt: use a new idempotencyKey for each distinct receipt
POST {{base}}/stock-movements
Content-Type: application/json

{"ingredientId":1,"quantity":1,"reason":"Local example receipt","idempotencyKey":"example-receipt-001"}

### Read-only planner preview
POST {{base}}/kitchen-plans/preview
Content-Type: application/json

{"items":[{"menuId":1,"portions":20}]}

### Daily sales replaces the aggregate for that menu/date
POST {{base}}/sales
Content-Type: application/json

{"menuId":1,"businessDate":"2026-11-15","quantity":20,"stockout":false,"closed":false}
